<title>UK: Greenwich/Lewisham Rail Link sets 165 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>Greenwich/Lewisham Rail Link sets 165 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following amortising bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY GREENWICH LEWISHAM RAIL LINK PLC</p>
<p> AMT    165 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    11.OCT.20</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    11.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	130 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.75 PCT GILT DUE 2017</p>
<p> NOTES	AMORTISES IN UNEQUAL SEMI-ANNUAL INSTALMENTS FROM</p>
<p>		11.APR.06UNTIL MATURITY TO GIVE AN ACVERAGE LIFE</p>
<p>		OF 16.2 YEARS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
